spec: S07-06, S07-09, S07-10, S07-05, S07-17

Re-anchoring on a Document of its own (`ra-life`): a whole-Asset Thread and a span Thread are
orphaned by a push that drops the image and retypes the line; the next push restores both byte
for byte and they stay orphaned (sticky, `(unchanged)`); orphaned Threads are still listed,
replyable and resolvable; `push --json` carries the `threads` summary. Merged stdout+stderr.

```console
$ annotary -p rowan push ra-life.md
assets: 1 referenced, [..]
ra-life	[..]	v1

$ annotary -p rowan thread new ra-life --asset img/a.png -m "picture"
t1	asset img/a.png

$ annotary -p agent thread new ra-life "3:0-3:5" -m "hello?"
t2	v1:3:0-3:5 "hello"

$ annotary -p rowan push v2/ra-life.md --doc ra-life -m "no picture, no hello"
threads: 2 re-anchored — 0 anchored, 0 refined, 2 orphaned (+2 orphaned: t1, t2)
ra-life	[..]	v2

$ annotary -p agent thread list ra-life
t2	@scribe	v1:3 orphaned "hello"	hello?	[..]
t1	@rowan	asset img/a.png	picture	[..]

$ annotary -p agent thread list ra-life --json id,anchor
[{"id":"t2","anchor":{"version":1,"range":"3:0-3:5","status":"orphaned","exact":"hello"}},{"id":"t1","anchor":{"asset":"img/a.png"}}]

$ annotary -p rowan push v3/ra-life.md --doc ra-life -m "everything back"
assets: 1 referenced, [..]
threads: 2 re-anchored — 0 anchored, 0 refined, 2 orphaned (unchanged)
ra-life	[..]	v3 (same content as v1)

$ annotary -p agent thread reply ra-life t2 --resolve -m "still fine, orphaned or not"
t2.1	resolved

$ annotary -p agent thread list ra-life --all --status orphaned --json id,anchor,resolved
[{"id":"t2","anchor":{"version":1,"range":"3:0-3:5","status":"orphaned","exact":"hello"},"resolved":{"by":"scribe","at":"[..]","version":3}},{"id":"t1","anchor":{"asset":"img/a.png"}}]

$ annotary -p rowan push v4/ra-life.md --doc ra-life -m "ps" -q --json name,version,threads
{"name":"ra-life","version":4,"threads":{"re_anchored":2,"anchored":0,"refined":0,"orphaned":2}}

```
